      "CONSEQUENCE": "the rival names the fourth arm joint arm4_Joiint and the production root names it arm4_Joint, so the MoveIt planning group cannot bind to the production description as it stands. The rival's planning authority covers structure -- groups, end effector, solver choice -- and does not carry over to the production root without a rename that is itself an apparatus change",
